        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="note" value="Most built-in handlers also call provenance-store directly&lt;br&gt;(check, coverage, report, import, init). Only the host&lt;br&gt;path goes through the catalog, so it shares routes,&lt;br&gt;access and failures with HTTP clients." style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=12;fontColor=#1a1a1a;" vertex="1" parent="1">
